Practice: lowest so far: replace `best` when `show.rating < best.rating`.
--- mistakes
- `>` instead of `<` (the highest rating).
- `<=` instead of `<`: on the tie, How I Met Your Mother wins instead of The Crown.
- No empty-list check: a crash on `best.name`.
